NetScope-DomainScanner
TLM-Audit-Scanner
wp2shell-check
ProxyChecker
RootEvidence
InfoGuardDisclosureResearch
recon-(crawler|engine)

# -- 2026-11 live-log mining (edge v, 2026-06..11) --------------------------
# Self-identifying scanners / probe tools seen as type=regular with 50-100% 404.
# Skipped on purpose: ForestEngine (also appended to forged Chrome UAs, ambiguous),
# fasthttp / Custom-AsyncHttpClient / WordPress/6.4.3 (too generic), and
# Let's Encrypt validation server (legitimate ACME validation).
# LeakIX l9scan (l9explore / l9tcpid are listed above)
l9scan
odin-scanner
WP-Safe-Scanner
CMS-Checker
CMS-Security-Auditor
vuln_scanner
symfony-scanner
Go Web Pentest Tool
research-scan
pathscan
V3-Hunt
ExposureWatch
# Ruhr-University Bochum softsec measurement scanners
Software Security Research
# CVE-named probe UAs (cve-2026-87902-poc, metabase-cve-2026-72898-detect)
cve-[0-9]+-[0-9]+.*(poc|detect)
# UA field carrying the WordPress installer URL probe
wp-admin/install\.php
bitdiscovery
HTTP Banner Detection
CyberConvoyScout
WebSiphon
rawgrab
